&lt;p&gt;commit c09868cfc90827fe7ed92a855ef1547e60953f71&lt;br/&gt;
Author: Aleksey Plekhanov &amp;lt;plehanov.alex@...&amp;gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Date:   2018-03-28T15:00:47Z&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8033&quot; title=&quot;Flaky failure TxOptimisticDeadlockDetectionCrossCacheTest.testDeadlock on TC&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8033&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8033&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Event listener&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;hr /&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16417609" author="alex_pl" created="Wed, 28 Mar 2018 15:55:06 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There was a race in prepare stage of commit and transactions can be commited without deadlock. The existing barrier is useless because locks are acquired at commit stage. The existing &lt;tt&gt;TestCommunicationSpi&lt;/tt&gt; does not blocks transaction threads because locked objects located on the local node and the &lt;tt&gt;GridNearTxPrepareRequest&lt;/tt&gt; message is not sent. To block transaction threads the &lt;tt&gt;TestCommunicationSpi&lt;/tt&gt; was replaced by event listener, which invoked even when transaction affects only one node.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt;, please review the patch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16418779" author="alex_pl" created="Thu, 29 Mar 2018 11:16:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Sometimes test on TC is still failing. Ticket moved to IP for further investigation.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16440407" author="alex_pl" created="Tue, 17 Apr 2018 05:42:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Another problem was with waiting for exchange. Method &lt;tt&gt;awaitPartitionMapExchange&lt;/tt&gt; waited for 2.0 topology version, even with &lt;tt&gt;waitEvicts&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;waitNode2PartUpdate&lt;/tt&gt; flags set. But it was topology version change (version 2.1) after rebalance triggered by &lt;tt&gt;CacheAffinityChangeMessage&lt;/tt&gt; which affects affinity. Ticket is ready for review now, &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt; please have a look.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16441070" author="agura" created="Tue, 17 Apr 2018 15:53:21 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;LGTM. Merged to master branch. Thanks for contribution!&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16441134" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 17 Apr 2018 16:41:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=alex_pl&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;alex_pl&quot;&gt;alex_pl&lt;/a&gt; thank you for contribution from me too.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt; probably we need to update version 2.5 -&amp;gt; 2.6, needn&apos;t we ?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16441138" author="dpavlov" created="Tue, 17 Apr 2018 16:45:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agura&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agura&quot;&gt;agura&lt;/a&gt; sorry, I&apos;ve found commit&#160;cd59c8e64f05ca03c7da8dc35d027a14fcebf250 in 2.5&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
